  "description": "AES-256-GCM at-rest secret protector. ISecretProtector encrypts sensitive secrets (API keys, webhook signing secrets, payment credentials) with a single configured key. ITenantSecretProtector (1.1.0) adds per-tenant keys derived via HKDF from a versioned master keyring, so one tenant cannot decrypt another's credential, with zero-downtime key rotation. Key material lives only in a secrets manager, never the database.",
